Description: CaramOS over-the-air update and offline audit tools
 Provides a CaramOS-specific OTA update command, daily update check,
 desktop notifier, state tracking, logs, best-effort rollback support,
 an offline hardware/session audit bundle creator for bug reports,
 Driver Check, which tells at first login which drivers are missing,
 and Feedback & Help, which sends requests with screenshots and short
 screen recordings to Vietnam Linux Family.
 .
 Users only need to run: sudo caramos-ota
 .
 Features:
  - CLI-based update check, install, status, repair, and rollback
  - Daily automatic check via systemd timer
  - Desktop notification with GTK3 dialog (Vietnamese and English)
  - Privilege escalation through pkexec/polkit
  - Transaction logging and best-effort rollback
